  "question": {
    "text": "An asteroid is moving directly towards the centre&nbsp;of the earth. When at a distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mi>R</mi></math> (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is the radius of the earth) from the centre of the earth, it has a speed of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>.</mo></math> Neglecting the effect of earth&#39;s atmosphere, what will be the speed of the asteroid when it hits the surface of the earth (escape velocity from the earth is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>11.2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo></math> ? Give your answer to the nearest integer in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>__________."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "16",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>K</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></math><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi></mi><mi>m</mi><msubsup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi></mi><mi>m</mi><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mrow><mn>12</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>11.2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>144</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0.9</mn><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>11.2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>156.896</mn></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>16.028</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>km</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>&nbsp;</p>"
